#: ../../site/guides/reports-runtime.md:1
msgid "Reports, runtime and extensions"
msgstr "报告、运行时与扩展"

#: ../../site/guides/reports-runtime.md:3
msgid ""
"Report schema 2 is a shared typed document. Native HTML, XLSX, PDF and "
"Plotly/Bokeh projections consume the same computed values; they are not a "
"promise of Python/pandas byte identity. Artifact bundles write a versioned "
"manifest and reject unsafe or preexisting destinations according to their "
"API contract."
msgstr ""
"报告 schema 2 是一种共享的类型化文档。原生 HTML、XLSX、PDF 以及 Plotly/Bokeh "
"投影使用相同的计算值；它们并不承诺与 Python/pandas 逐字节一致。产物包会写入带"
"版本的清单，并依据其 API 契约拒绝不安全或已存在的目标位置。"

#: ../../site/guides/reports-runtime.md:9
msgid ""
"The runtime catalog exposes typed operations with explicit inputs and "
"deterministic serialization where documented. Sessions cache deterministic "
"operations, own their inputs/outputs and reject calls after close."
msgstr ""
"运行时操作目录提供具有显式输入的类型化操作，并在文档说明之处提供确定性序列"
"化。会话会缓存确定性操作，拥有其输入/输出，并在关闭后拒绝调用。"

#: ../../site/guides/reports-runtime.md:13
msgid ""
"Extension discovery consumes the native snapshot/hook ABI described by the "
"public extension headers. Optional plotting adapters are not part of the "
"core CMake consumer contract and must be enabled explicitly."
msgstr ""
"扩展发现机制使用公共扩展头文件所描述的原生快照/钩子 ABI。可选的绘图适配器不属"
"于核心 CMake 使用方契约，必须显式启用。"
